  "title": "Trump's Stephen Miller as Chief of Staff Sets Up Immigration Struggles",
  "summary": "With Stephen Miller appointed as his chief of staff, Trump aims to navigate potential political challenges and align with Congress, while his role as a key architect of his immigration policies may strain relations with opposition groups.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Stephan Miller, a loyal partisan, is now the chief of staff for President Donald Trump, marking a significant shift in the administration.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Trump’s decision to appoint him as chief of staff is expected to create potential conflicts with Congress and political opposition.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Miller’s comments on his role in supporting Trump’s immigration agenda highlight concerns about the administration’s alignment with far-right policies.",
